                             },
                 "view":  {
                              "value":  "\u003ch3 local-id=\"c2abc3826806\" id=\"ChangeininvoicepaymentdeadlinedatecalculationforRPSPODs-Userstory\"\u003eUser story\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"53d69d7e204c\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAs a\u003c/strong\u003e Billing Specialist,\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"df6d1fddf028\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eI want\u003c/strong\u003e the billing run to calculate a different due date for PODs with the RPS parameter,\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"774239eb256b\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSo that\u003c/strong\u003e invoices for those PODs have the correct due date according to RPS requirements, while all other PODs continue to use the standard due date calculation.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"2b7532d84910\" /\u003e\u003ch3 local-id=\"487616b024c9\" id=\"ChangeininvoicepaymentdeadlinedatecalculationforRPSPODs-Storydescription\"\u003eStory description\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"4b3c460fea52\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"/wiki/spaces/Phoenix/pages/970424328/OPS+-+RPS\" data-linked-resource-id=\"970424328\" data-linked-resource-version=\"2\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\"\u003eOPS - RPS\u003c/a\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"c7a750492eac\" /\u003e\u003ch3 local-id=\"32924047e512\" id=\"ChangeininvoicepaymentdeadlinedatecalculationforRPSPODs-Acceptancecriteria:\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAcceptance criteria:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003col start=\"1\" local-id=\"e0bd5fd7d168\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"de9efb84a494\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"d85ee34085bf\"\u003eIf an invoice includes at least one POD with RPS and the invoice due date is set to âAccording to contractâ the due date should be calculated based on the RPS nomenclature date\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\" local-id=\"cef01dde142f\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"130a48b369a6\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"3b72262686b2\"\u003eThe due date should be calculated from the invoice date.\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\" local-id=\"ba477dad5a85\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"ac00946a9d40\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"5e74961f5b7f\"\u003e For example, if the nomenclature indicates 5, and the invoice date is 7 May, the due date will be 5 June   \u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"9aa2fc287fca\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"dd8fc4847c54\"\u003eThe system should use the default calendar to determine working and non-working days.\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\" local-id=\"acdb4995c48a\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"05f20b605706\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"cf53c3a26121\"\u003eIf the calculated due date falls on a non-working day, it will be adjusted to the nearest working day.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"2efab11b992a\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"2dce67b00336\"\u003eIf there is no default calendar, return error on specific invoice\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\" local-id=\"cfd98fcc1922\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"0a5f0b81e31d\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"8123f1409b89\"\u003eerror message: âBilling run cannot be started. The run includes PODs with RPS, and a default calendar is required to calculate invoice payment deadlines for these PODsâ\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"d88982ffe5c1\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"4d582edce0fa\"\u003e if for one invoice there are two different RPS numbers linked, billing run should return error: \u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\" local-id=\"a3da935f7101\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"025553e2d8cc\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"cfbb0ec3ae28\"\u003eIf a contract has two PODs, both with RPS and different RPS numbers, and they belong to the same billing group and are included in the same invoice, the billing run should return an error - error is returned on specific invoice, not whole billing\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\" local-id=\"f1e3caa3cf62\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"b18d63f3ae9c\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"16902f34c96f\"\u003eEven if assigned RPS numbers have the same dates  in nomenclature, it still should return error\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"847fbf436b05\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"7eb220c55caa\"\u003eIf a contract has two PODs, both with RPS and different RPS numbers and they belong to the different billing group or same billing group but should be split into different invoices, billing run should not return error and calculate due date for each invoice separately based on different RPS numbers\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"9005d446efd6\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"aa849b229f4b\"\u003eIf a contract has two PODs, one with RPS and the other without it and they belong to the same billing group and are included in the same invoice, the billing run should calculate due date using RPS number in nomenclature\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"6fccd2ef3a3d\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"a72ce639a3ee\"\u003eIf a contract has two PODs, one with RPS and the other without it and they belong to the different billing group or same billing group but should be split into different invoices, billing run should calculate due date for each invoice separately: for RPS pod based on RPS nomenclature and for non RPS pod based on contract. \u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"7044714fb1dd\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"70e502a58f90\"\u003e If âAccording to contractâ is not selected, system should ignore date indicated in nomenclature and take due date from billing run.\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"b2fa0aed04cb\" /\u003e\u003ch3 local-id=\"ba4ceada64e8\" id=\"ChangeininvoicepaymentdeadlinedatecalculationforRPSPODs-Notes:\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNotes:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul local-id=\"2f87f08f186e\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"c359d05923ec\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"c6033461444a\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThis change affects following billing run flows, only for product contract:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul local-id=\"37927726a841\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"84748b6d7064\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"32e66c71da6a\"\u003estandard billing run\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul local-id=\"d300d12b9f42\"\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"f31d4ad0cd97\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"844d7d0115fc\"\u003eFor volumes\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"469840e5b23e\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"6b3a3ef1d361\"\u003eOver time periodical (when level is POD)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"821e637045b4\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"dcc05694bd84\"\u003eOver time one time (when level is POD)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"c0d02b528460\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"70d9fa6840f8\"\u003eWith electricity invoice\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli local-id=\"3f0ff699cc27\"\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"90abd106f50d\"\u003einvoice correction\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"d3d5c159046f\"\u003eÂ \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp local-id=\"e64a286cbe02\"\u003eÂ \u003c/p\u003e",
